@startuml
title Harness：工具结果后更新“正在执行”状态
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false

actor 用户 as User
participant "A2UI Client" as Client
participant "A2aAgentExecutor" as Executor
participant "Harness MainGraph" as Graph
database "HarnessState" as State
participant "Data Query Tool\n图 03" as QueryTool

User -> Client : 询问金油比走势
Client -> Executor : A2A request
Executor -> Graph : task_id + original_question
Graph -> State : Initialize\n追加 root CommandRecord(pending)

Graph -> QueryTool : ExecuteCurrentCommand 的 tool_call
QueryTool --> Graph : ToolMessage\nSQL + data + meta_data
Graph -> State : RegisterCommandResult\nroot -> succeeded
Graph -> Graph : EvaluateCurrentCommand = succeeded

Graph -> Graph : AssessPresentation = skip
Graph -> Graph : DecideNextGoal\n下一步：获取油价
Graph -> State : AppendNextCommand\n追加 query CommandRecord(pending)
Graph -> State : UpdateExecutingStatus\n状态栏 = “正在执行：获取油价”
Graph --> Executor : 最新 A2UI surface（仅状态栏 data model 更新）
Executor --> Client : A2A artifact / surface update

Graph -> QueryTool : 执行 CommandList[-1]

note over Graph,State
UpdateExecutingStatus 是固定代码节点：
不调用 LLM、不新增 CommandRecord、不产生 ToolMessage。
因此 MainGraph 随后执行的仍是唯一的最后一条 pending 命令。
end note
@enduml
